          "description": "Trigger a transactional email event, causing Inxmail to send an email to the recipient specified in the payload. This is a write operation — it dispatches an actual email. Use get_event_state with the returned transactionId to check delivery outcome. Provide a transactionId for deduplication within a 72-hour window. Returns the transaction ID and acceptance status.",
